OL,2,W+.!/*% *%*%/*%,.! /.!/*%,.!S,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 23 SEP
OL,4,CTELETEXT
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1974FThe world's first teletext
OL,7,Fservice - Ceefax - is formally launched
OL,8,Fby the BBC. Test transmissions had
OL,9,Falready been taking place since 1972.
OL,10,FSoon after the BBC developed Ceefax,
OL,11,Fthe IBA created a similar, though
OL,12,Fincompatible system called ORACLE. In
OL,13,F1976, The BBC and IBA agreed a new
OL,14,Fstandard, known as World System
OL,15,FTeletext.
OL,16,
OL,17,FAlthough sales of suitably equipped TV
OL,18,Fsets were slow in the early years,
OL,19,Fteletext would become a familiar sight
OL,20,Fin many households by the late-1980s.
OL,21,
OL,22,FThe original teletext format was
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBOn This DayCClean FeedFNat TV
